# Inside of the bypass tunnel (decorative, non-solid, like
# wall_village_bg): flat d, darker than every solid tile, no lip. The
# ceiling cell (open top, tunnel below) shows a faint m lining line with
# a segment rib; the lower cell a m walkway line 4 px above the road.
# Left/right bits don't change the look (seamless into the hill and up
# to the portal). A cell open above and below shows the lower look, so
# a cell under tunnel_bg_lamp stays the lower wall.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_tunnel_bg
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
---
frame auto 0
mddddddddddddddd
mddddddddddddddd
